# Shell scripts must stay LF no matter what checks them out. On Windows,
# git's core.autocrlf would otherwise rewrite docker-entrypoint.sh to
# CRLF on the next checkout -- a CRLF shebang line breaks `exec` inside
# the Linux container (the kernel looks for an interpreter literally
# named "/bin/sh\r", which doesn't exist).
*.sh text eol=lf
